---
// Three requests against the mux from routes(); outcomes come from the code and the curl runs in the post.
const rows = [
  {
    req: 'GET /todos/7',
    pat: ['GET /todos/{id}', ''],
    en: ['getTodo runs, PathValue("id") is "7"', '200 with the todo, or 404 if unknown'],
    vi: ['getTodo chạy, PathValue("id") là "7"', '200 kèm todo, hoặc 404 nếu không có'],
    own: false,
  },
  {
    req: 'GET /todos/abc',
    pat: ['GET /todos/{id}', ''],
    en: ['getTodo runs, strconv.Atoi fails', '400 {"error":"id must be a number"}'],
    vi: ['getTodo chạy, strconv.Atoi báo lỗi', '400 {"error":"id must be a number"}'],
    own: false,
  },
  {
    req: 'DELETE /todos',
    pat: ['GET /todos', 'POST /todos'],
    en: ['No handler runs: the mux answers itself', '405 with Allow: GET, HEAD, POST'],
    vi: ['Không handler nào chạy: mux tự trả lời', '405 kèm Allow: GET, HEAD, POST'],
    own: true,
  },
];
const W = 900;
const top = 62;
const rowH = 92;
const H = top + rows.length * rowH + 4;
const cx = [20, 250, 520];
---
<figure class="gp10m">
  <div class="gp10m-scroll">
  <svg viewBox={`0 0 ${W} ${H}`} role="img" aria-label="Three requests against the mux: GET /todos/7 and GET /todos/abc both match GET /todos/{id} and reach getTodo; DELETE /todos matches no method, so the mux answers 405 itself.">
    <text x={cx[0]} y="26" class="h"><tspan data-lang-en>Request</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Request</tspan></text>
    <text x={cx[1]} y="26" class="h"><tspan data-lang-en>Patterns for this path</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Pattern cho path này</tspan></text>
    <text x={cx[2]} y="26" class="h"><tspan data-lang-en>What happens</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Điều xảy ra</tspan></text>
    <line x1="20" x2={W - 20} y1="40" y2="40" class="grid" />
    {rows.map((r, i) => {
      const y = top + i * rowH;
      return (
        <g>
          <rect x={cx[0]} y={y} width="190" height="56" rx="8" class="box" />
          <text x={cx[0] + 95} y={y + 33} text-anchor="middle" class="b">{r.req}</text>
          <line x1={cx[0] + 192} x2={cx[1] - 10} y1={y + 28} y2={y + 28} class="grid" style="stroke: var(--text-muted)" /><polygon points={`${cx[1] - 2},${y + 28} ${cx[1] - 11},${y + 23} ${cx[1] - 11},${y + 33}`} class="bar" />
          <rect x={cx[1]} y={y} width="220" height="56" rx="8" class="box" />
          {r.pat[1] === '' ? (
            <text x={cx[1] + 110} y={y + 33} text-anchor="middle" class="b">{r.pat[0]}</text>
          ) : (
            <g>
              <text x={cx[1] + 110} y={y + 24} text-anchor="middle" class="b">{r.pat[0]}</text>
              <text x={cx[1] + 110} y={y + 44} text-anchor="middle" class="b">{r.pat[1]}</text>
            </g>
          )}
          <line x1={cx[1] + 222} x2={cx[2] - 10} y1={y + 28} y2={y + 28} class="grid" style="stroke: var(--text-muted)" /><polygon points={`${cx[2] - 2},${y + 28} ${cx[2] - 11},${y + 23} ${cx[2] - 11},${y + 33}`} class="bar" />
          <rect x={cx[2]} y={y} width="360" height="56" rx="8" class={r.own ? 'own' : 'box'} />
          <text x={cx[2] + 14} y={y + 24} class="b"><tspan data-lang-en>{r.en[0]}</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>{r.vi[0]}</tspan></text>
          <text x={cx[2] + 14} y={y + 44} class="m"><tspan data-lang-en>{r.en[1]}</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>{r.vi[1]}</tspan></text>
        </g>
      );
    })}
  </svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption>
    <span data-lang-en>The mux first looks for a pattern that matches the path, then checks the method. In the last row the path matches but no registered method does, so the mux writes the 405 and the <code>Allow</code> header itself and your handlers never run (dashed box).</span>
    <span data-lang-vi>Mux tìm pattern khớp với path trước, rồi mới kiểm tra method. Ở hàng cuối, path khớp nhưng không method nào đã đăng ký khớp, nên mux tự viết mã 405 và header <code>Allow</code>, handler của bạn không chạy (khung nét đứt).</span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .gp10m { margin: 2em 0; width: 100%; }
  .gp10m-scroll { overflow-x: auto; }
  .gp10m svg { display: block; width: 100%; min-width: 640px; height: auto; }
  .gp10m text { font-size: 14px; fill: var(--text-body); }
  .gp10m .h { font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .gp10m .b { font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .gp10m .m { fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .gp10m .r { fill: var(--red); font-weight: 700; }
  .gp10m .num { font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
  .gp10m .box { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.2; }
  .gp10m .own { fill: none; stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.2; stroke-dasharray: 4 3; }
  .gp10m .bad { fill: var(--red-tint-bg); stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 1.2; }
  .gp10m .bar { fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .gp10m .limit { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.2; }
  .gp10m .grid { stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1; }
  .gp10m .redline { stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 1.5; stroke-dasharray: 5 4; }
  .gp10m .ln { fill: none; stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.5; }
  .gp10m .ln.dash { stroke-dasharray: 3 4; }
  .gp10m .ln.red { stroke: var(--red); }
  .gp10m .hd { fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .gp10m .hd.red { fill: var(--red); }
  .gp10m figcaption { margin-top: 10px; font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.55; text-align: center; }
</style>
